{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הוֹדוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" קִרְאוּ בִשְׁמוֹ הוֹדִיעוּ בָעַמִּים עֲלִילֹתָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שִׁירוּ לוֹ זַמְּרוּ־לוֹ שִׂיחוּ בְּכָל־נִפְלְאֹתָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הִתְהַלְלוּ בְּשֵׁם קָדְשׁוֹ יִשְׂמַח לֵב מְבַקְשֵׁי "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":": "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"דִּרְשׁוּ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" וְעֻזּוֹ בַּקְּשׁוּ פָנָיו תָּמִיד: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זִכְרוּ נִפְלְאֹתָיו אֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה מֹפְתָיו וּמִשְׁפְּטֵי־פִיהוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זֶרַע יִשְׂרָאֵל עַבְדּוֹ בְּנֵי יַעֲקֹב בְּחִירָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הוּא "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֱלֹהֵינוּ בְּכָל־הָאָרֶץ מִשְׁפָּטָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זִכְרוּ לְעוֹלָם בְּרִיתוֹ דָּבָר צִוָּה לְאֶלֶף דּוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֲשֶׁר כָּרַת אֶת־אַבְרָהָם וּשְׁבוּעָתוֹ "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n61.jpg","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"לְיִצְחָק: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַיַּעֲמִידֶהָ לְיַעֲקֹב לְחֹק לְיִשְׂרָאֵל בְּרִית עוֹלָם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֵאמֹר לְךָ אֶתֵּן אֶרֶץ־כְּנָעַן חֶבֶל נַחֲלַתְכֶם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בִּהְיוֹתְכֶם מְתֵי מִסְפָּר כִּמְעַט וְגָרִים בָּהּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַיִּתְהַלְּכוּ מִגּוֹי אֶל־גּוֹי וּמִמַּמְלָכָה אֶל־עַם אַחֵר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֹא־הִנִּיחַ לְאִישׁ לְעָשְׁקָם וַיּוֹכַח עֲלֵיהֶם מְלָכִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/22","n":"22"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אַל־תִּגְּעוּ בִמְשִׁיחָי וּבִנְבִיאַי אַל־תָּרֵעוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/23","n":"23"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שִׁירוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כָּל־הָאָרֶץ בַּשְּׂרוּ מִיּוֹם־אֶל־יוֹם יְשׁוּעָתוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/24","n":"24"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"סַפְּרוּ בַגּוֹיִם אֶת־כְּבוֹדוֹ בְּכָל־הָעַמִּים נִפְלְאֹתָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/25","n":"25"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי גָדוֹל "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" וּמְהֻלָּל מְאֹד וְנוֹרָא הוּא עַל־כָּל־אֱלֹהִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/26","n":"26"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי כָּל־אֱלֹהֵי הָעַמִּים אֱלִילִים. וַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" שָׁמַיִם עָשָׂה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/27","n":"27"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הוֹד וְהָדָר לְפָנָיו עֹז וְחֶדְוָה בִּמְקֹמוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/28","n":"28"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הָבוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מִשְׁפְּחוֹת עַמִּים הָבוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כָּבוֹד וָעֹז: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/29","n":"29"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הָבוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כְּבוֹד שְׁמוֹ שְׂאוּ מִנְחָה וּבֹאוּ לְפָנָיו הִשְׁתַּחֲווּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּהַדְרַת־קֹדֶשׁ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/30","n":"30"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"חִילוּ מִלְּפָנָיו כָּל־הָאָרֶץ אַף־תִּכּוֹן תֵּבֵל בַּל־תִּמּוֹט: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/31","n":"31"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִשְׂמְחוּ הַשָּׁמַיִם וְתָגֵל הָאָרֶץ וְיֹאמְרוּ בַגּוֹיִם "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מָלָךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/32","n":"32"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִרְעַם הַיָּם וּמְלוֹאוֹ יַעֲלֹץ הַשָּׂדֶה וְכָל־אֲשֶׁר־בּוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/33","n":"33"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אָז יְרַנְּנוּ עֲצֵי הַיָּעַר מִלִּפְנֵי "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כִּי־בָא לִשְׁפּוֹט אֶת־הָאָרֶץ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/34","n":"34"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הוֹדוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כִּי טוֹב כִּי לְעוֹלָם חַסְדּוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/35","n":"35"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וְאִמְרוּ הוֹשִׁיעֵנוּ אֱלֹהֵי יִשְׁעֵנוּ וְקַבְּצֵנוּ וְהַצִּילֵנוּ מִן־הַגּוֹיִם לְהוֹדוֹת לְשֵׁם קָדְשֶׁךָ לְהִשְׁתַּבֵּחַ בִּתְהִלָּתֶךָ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/36","n":"36"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בָּרוּךְ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֱלֹהֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל מִן־הָעוֹלָם וְעַד־הָעוֹלָם וַיֹּאמְרוּ כָל־הָעָם אָמֵן וְהַלֵּל לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":": "}
